                <h1 id="main-heading">Aerosol Chemistry 101: Complete Guide to Solvents, Binders, Surfactants &amp; Additives</h1>

                <div style="border:1px solid #e5e7eb;background:#f9fafb;padding:12px;border-radius:6px;margin:12px 0;">
